sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Capability Runner model-free replay
    accDescr: A saved capability is loaded and its inputs are validated. Replay checks fresh page state and sends each prescribed action through the Action Gateway. The final state determines typed success, an expected business outcome, or failure. Replay never calls the model.
    autonumber
    participant Runner as UI / Runner
    participant Store as Artifact Store
    participant Replay
    participant Gateway
    participant Browser

    Runner->>Store: Load validated artifact and profile
    Store-->>Runner: Typed steps, targets and conditions
    Runner->>Replay: Start browser replay with new inputs
    Replay->>Replay: Validate inputs and bind parameters
    Note over Replay,Browser: Replay makes no model calls
    loop Each prescribed step
        Replay->>Browser: Observe current page state
        Browser-->>Replay: Fresh evidence
        Replay->>Replay: Check preconditions
        Replay->>Gateway: Submit saved action
        Gateway->>Gateway: Check policy and session ownership
        Gateway->>Browser: Dispatch authorized action
        Browser-->>Gateway: Action result
        Gateway-->>Replay: Recorded execution outcome
    end
    Replay->>Browser: Collect final page evidence
    Browser-->>Replay: Current identity and output fields
    alt Success conditions match
        Replay-->>Runner: SUCCESS with typed outputs
    else Declared business condition matches
        Replay-->>Runner: BUSINESS_OUTCOME, e.g. MEMBER_NOT_FOUND
    else Completion cannot be verified
        Replay-->>Runner: FAILURE with evidence context
    end
    Runner->>Runner: Present structured result
